JSONRPCServer -- JSONRPC server class
*************************************

  * Usage: 
        new JSONRPCServer

Description
===========

JSONRPCServer is the core class of the package, responsible for handling
JSON-RPC requests. It allows you to *note register methods: registerMethod,,
*note process incoming requests: handleRequest, (including batches), and send
appropriate responses or error messages, all while following the JSON-RPC 2.0
specification (see https://www.jsonrpc.org/specification ).  The class also
includes basic *note logging functionality: setLogger, to track incoming
requests and responses.

+-------------------------------+
|i1 : server = new JSONRPCServer|
|                               |
|o1 = server                    |
|                               |
|o1 : JSONRPCServer             |
+-------------------------------+
* Menu:

* registerMethod::              register a method for a JSON-RPC server
* handleRequest::               handle a JSON-RPC request
* setLogger::                   set up logging for a JSON-RPC server

