Description
===========

This method behaves much like the usual *note methods: (Macaulay2Doc)methods,
method.  It lists each of the methods that have been registered to the given
server.

+--------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : server = new JSONRPCServer                                     |
|                                                                    |
|o1 = server                                                         |
|                                                                    |
|o1 : JSONRPCServer                                                  |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : registerMethod(server, "add", (x, y) -> x + y)                 |
